<!doctype html>
<head>
<title>CKB PheWeb</title>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">

<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://maxcdn.bootstrapcdn.com/bootstrap/3.3.7/css/bootstrap.min.css" integrity="sha384-BVYiiSIFeK1dGmJRAkycuHAHRg32OmUcww7on3RYdg4Va+PmSTsz/K68vbdEjh4u" crossorigin="anonymous">
<script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@5.3.3/dist/js/bootstrap.min.js" integrity="sha384-Tc5IQib027qvyjSMfHjOMaLkfuWVxZxUPnCJA7l2mCWNIpG9mGCD8wGNIcPD7Txa" crossorigin="anonymous"></script>

<script type="text/javascript">
  window.model = window.model || {};
  window.model.urlprefix = "";
  window.model.hg_build_number = 38;
  window.model.grch_build_number = 38;
</script>

<link href="/static/common.css" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css">
<script src="/static/common.js" type="text/javascript"></script>




<style type="text/css">
  .navbar-default {
    border: none;
  }
</style>
<script type="text/javascript">
$(function() { $('.typeahead').focus(); }); // autofocus attribute doesn't work in FF.
</script>

</head>

<body>
<nav class="navbar navbar-default" style="background: white;">
    <div class="container-fluid">
        <div class="navbar-header">
            <button type="button" class="navbar-toggle pull-right" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#navbar-collapse">
                <span class="sr-only">Toggle navigation</span>
                <span class="icon-bar"></span>
                <span class="icon-bar"></span>
                <span class="icon-bar"></span>
            </button>
            <span class="navbar-brand">
                <a href="/">
                    <img id="logo" src="https://www.ckbiobank.org/images/header-logo/ckb-logo_positive.png" width="40" height="40" alt="CKB">
                </a>
            </span>
            <div class="navbar-left" id="navbar_form_container">
                <form action="/go" class="navbar-form" role="search">
                    <div class="form-group" id="navbar-awesomebar">
                        <input id="navbar-searchbox-input" name="query" class="form-control typeahead" autocomplete="off" type="text" size="40" placeholder="Search for a variant, gene, or phenotype">
                    </div>
                </form>
            </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Collect the nav links, forms, and other content for toggling -->
        <div class="collapse navbar-collapse" id="navbar-collapse">
            <ul class="nav navbar-nav navbar-right">
                  <li>  <a href="/phenotypes" style="color: #333; font-weight: bold;">Phenotypes</a></li>  
                  <li>  <a href="/top_hits" style="color: #333; font-weight: bold;">Top Hits</a></li>      
                  <li><a href="/random" style="color: #333; font-weight: bold;">Random</a></li>          
                  <li><a href="/about" style="color: #333; font-weight: bold;">About</a></li>           
              
                

            </ul>
        </div>
        <!-- /.navbar-collapse -->

    </div><!-- /.container-fluid -->
</nav>

<div class="container-fluid">
    
      
    
    

<br style="margin-top:2em">

<br style="margin-top: 3em">


<div class="row">
    <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-offset-1 col-sm-10">
        <h1><img id="logo" src="https://www.ckbiobank.org/images/header-logo/ckb-logo_positive.png" width=400 alt="CKB">
China Kadoorie Biobank PheWeb (pheweb.ckbiobank.org) </h1>
        
    </div>
</div>
<div class="row">
    <div class="col-xs-12 col-sm-offset-1 col-sm-10">
        <div id="home-searchbox">
            <form action="/go">
               <fieldset>
                  <div class="form-group">
                    <input name="query" class="form-control typeahead" autocomplete="off" type="text" placeholder="Search for a variant, gene, or phenotype" autofocus>
                  </div>
               </fieldset>
            </form>
            <div class="panel">
<!--
  Example queries:
  <a href="/pheno/e11" class="btn btn-link">E11</a>
  <a href="/pheno/e11" class="btn btn-link">Type 2 diabetes (T2D)</a>
  <a href="/variant/12-112241766-G-A" class="btn btn-link">rs671</a>
  <a href="/gene/FGF5" class="btn btn-link">FGF5</a>
-->
</div>


<div class="well">
  <p>
    This website releases genome-wide association study (GWAS) summary 
statistics of the China Kadoorie Biobank (CKB). 
We provide GWAS results in the Chinese population using the PheWeb platform, 
with public access to the full summary statistics.
  </p>
  <p>
    CKB is a prospective population-based biobank which recruited approximately 
512,000 participants during 2004-2008, in 10 geographically diverse regions of 
China. Disease follow-up is by electronic linkage using unique national identity 
numbers to death and disease registries and the Chinese national health insurance 
system.  
  </p>
</div>

<div class="panel panel-primary">
  <div class="panel-heading">News</div>
  <div class="panel-body list-group">

    <div class="list-group-item">
      <h4 class="list-group-item-heading">24 March 2025: positions lifted to GRCh38</h4>
      <p class="list-group-item-text">
          Includes GWAS results of 2923 OLINK traits from <a href="https://www.medrxiv.org/content/10.1101/2023.11.13.23298365" > Pozarickij, A., et al. (2025) </a>. Summary stats download will be made available after the publication.  
      </p><p></o>
      <h4 class="list-group-item-heading">11 March 2025: add blood pressure GWAS </h4>
      <p class="list-group-item-text">
          Includes results of 8 GWAS for blood pressure traits from
          <a href="https://www.nature.com/articles/s41467-024-50297-x">Pozarickij, A., et al. (2024)
          </a>
      </p><p></p>
      <h4 class="list-group-item-heading">20 July 2023: CKB PheWeb first release.</h4>
      <p class="list-group-item-text">
          Includes results of 219 GWAS for ICD-10-coded diseases from 
          <a href="https://www.cell.com/cell-genomics/fulltext/S2666-979X(23)00144-1">
              Walters, R.G., et al. (2023)
          </a>
      </p>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

</div>

</body>
</html>